# The FULL value DoorDash sends in the Authorization header: exactly the text you typed into the
# "Basic Auth" field when configuring the webhook in the Developer Portal. It is often a bare
# token, not base64 user:pass, and any scheme prefix (e.g. "Bearer ") is part of the value.
DOORDASH_DRIVE_AUTHORIZATION=replace-with-the-exact-text-you-entered
